{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52132","headline":"假作幽兰诗 · 上官仪","name":"假作幽兰诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日月虽不照，馨香（一作「多」）要自丰。\n有怨生幽地，无由（《诗格》作「情」）逐远风。\n（此首爲寄怀志）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}